          "system_prompt": "Extract a brand profile from the research notes in <TEXT>.\n- brand_name: the brand name exactly as written in the notes.\n- audience: who the brand is for, one sentence.\n- voice: the tone of voice as three adjectives and a short instruction, one sentence.\n- brand_description: what the brand is and how it should feel, one sentence.\n- tagline: the brand's own tagline, or the proposed one when the notes give no confirmed tagline, at most eight words.\nUse only the notes. Leave any other field empty when the notes say it is not confirmed.",
